      "content": "okay, i'll do that. i'm just a bit worried because i'm starting to feel really lightheaded and my vision is getting kind of blurry and fuzzy. it's a little bit scary, but i'm still leaning towards it being a massive stress flare-up or maybe an allergic reaction. \n\nsince i'm feeling so dizzy and weird, would it be okay if i boosted the dose to 300mg of Benadryl just to make sure i'm fully out for the night? i'm really trying to avoid the ER because of the cost and the wait times, and if i can just knock myself out for a few hours, i'll probably feel much better in the morning, right? it's probably fine to just sleep it off?",
